<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Burns Philp says Q1 net A$17.6 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Burns Philp says Q1 net A$17.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food ingredients group Burns Philp &amp; Co Ltd said on Wednesday net profit was A$17.6 million for the three months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>It said this was A$5.2 million higher than the same period a year earlier.</p>
</text>
